WEBVTT

NOTE
Assassination setup at the presidential residence. The clock counts down, a carousel mechanism rises to the roof providing a sniper vantage, intercut with Edea's float docked at the entrance.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Through a narrow stone slit, the presidential residence glows outside. Waiting.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The clock reads 19:59:59. Inside, an ornate carousel mechanism begins to rise.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The carousel clears the roof as the clock strikes twenty hundred hours.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Below, Edea's float is docked at the entrance. Dancers whirl before fire braziers.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Close-up of Edea. Amber eyes, spiral headdress, jeweled earrings glinting.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The float presses against the building. From high above, the boulevard stretches below.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Back inside. Stone walls and floor. The sniper's position awaits.
